### Uji endpoint dengan ekstensi VS Code "REST Client" (humao.rest-client).
### Klik "Send Request" di atas tiap blok. Cookie login disimpan otomatis
### oleh REST Client, jadi jalankan register/login dulu sebelum /books.

@base = http://localhost:3000/api

### Health check
GET {{base}}/health

### Tanpa login → 401
GET {{base}}/books

### Register (201; jalankan sekali — kedua kalinya 409 karena email sudah ada)
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "fauzan@contoh.com", "password": "rahasia123" }

### Login (200) — cookie "token" ikut tersimpan
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "fauzan@contoh.com", "password": "rahasia123" }

### Siapa saya?
GET {{base}}/auth/me

### Tambah buku (201)
POST {{base}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Bumi Manusia", "author": "Pramoedya Ananta Toer", "status": "reading" }

### Validasi server gagal (400)
POST {{base}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "", "status": "baca" }

### Daftar buku milik saya (200)
GET {{base}}/books

### Satu buku (200 / 404 jika tidak ada / 403 jika milik user lain)
GET {{base}}/books/1

### Ubah buku (200) — PUT wajib mengirim semua field
PUT {{base}}/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Bumi Manusia", "author": "Pramoedya Ananta Toer", "status": "done" }

### Hapus buku (204)
DELETE {{base}}/books/1

### Logout (204) — cookie dihapus
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
